        <h2 class="split-title">Flexible Workflows</h2>
        <p class="split-desc">Define states, transitions, conditions and validators. Guide work through exactly the stages your process requires — without code.</p>
        <ul class="split-list">
          <li><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i> Visual state machine with colored status pills</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i> Conditions &amp; validators gate transitions</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i> Post-functions run automatically on transition</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="split-visual">
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-dot red"></span>
            <span class="code-dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="code-dot green"></span>
            <span class="code-filename">workflow.yaml</span>
